(7646259, 1242840, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Martus:</b></div><hr/><i> This is an interesting idea and I love the textures. However, to pull this off, I feel you need a bit more contrast between the leaf and the background. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I actually thought it turned out too contrasty, and wanted the leaf to merge with the background seamlessly, but as I was editing it on the phone, I had no way to judge.<br/> <br/>p.s. no texture layer was harmed (or used) in this image.</td>', 'Originally posted by Martus: This is an interesting idea and I love the textures. However, to pull this off, I feel you need a bit more contrast between the leaf and the background.  I actually thought it turned out too contrasty, and wanted the leaf to merge with the background seamlessly, but as I was editing it on the phone, I had no way to judge. p.s. no texture layer was harmed (or used) in this image.', '2019-11-13 01:28:20.000000', NULL, 0),
